sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Ingress
    participant Pipeline as Filter Pipeline
    participant Triage as Policy Triage
    participant Audit as Audit Trail

    User->>Ingress: Submit Prompt
    Ingress->>Pipeline: Route to filters

    Pipeline->>Pipeline: Pre-prompt Sanitization
    Pipeline->>Pipeline: Regex Fast Filters
    Pipeline->>Pipeline: Semantic Classification

    Pipeline->>Triage: Moderation Results & Scores
    Triage->>Triage: Apply Policy Thresholds
    Triage->>Triage: Determine Action (Strictest Wins)

    Triage->>Audit: Log Evaluation Decision
    Audit-->>Triage: Confirm Logged

    alt Action is BLOCK
        Triage-->>Ingress: Blocked Content Error
        Ingress-->>User: Reject Request
    else Action is FLAG
        Triage-->>Ingress: Proceed with Flag
        Ingress-->>User: Accept (Flagged)
    else Action is ALLOW
        Triage-->>Ingress: Proceed
        Ingress-->>User: Accept
    end
